# Ask before code

- Do not create, edit, delete, or run mutating commands on project source until the user reply contains the exact phrase `tôi đồng ý`.
- Exception: this rule file and other `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` the user explicitly asked to create.
- Before that phrase: explain plan, files, risks. Stop. Do not start implementation.
- After work: report (1) what changed, (2) files, (3) result/tests, (4) what was not done.
- Do not expand scope past the approved plan.
